# --- Local/runtime artifacts that should never be tracked ---------------
# JL Check's own session persistence lives under %LOCALAPPDATA%, outside
# this repo — nothing here to ignore for that. Any local scratch/test
# output dropped inside the repo by accident (e.g. a stray exported
# .json from test_write_quote.py) should be caught here too:
*.log